      "page": null,
      "source": "explicit-legal-numbering",
      "locator": ".TRS_Editor p[178]",
      "confidence": 1.0
    },
    {
      "level": 4,
      "text": "第五十八条 出租人应当在附注中披露与经营租赁有关的下列信息：",
